        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://visitcity.travel/en/prague/district/smichov"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Anděl corner, once dominated by factories, now hosts modern office buildings and shopping centres built a few years ago.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
